          "start": 505
        },
        "quote": "(e) 101.5.2, Low energy buildings, is hereby deleted in its entirety and the following provisions shall be substituted therefor:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.80.050 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "13d6f207-1556-5170-9fb3-fb452a51f47e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 865,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:7",
          "start": 634
        },
        "quote": "The following buildings, or portions thereof, separated from the remainder of the building by building thermal envelope assemblies complying with this code shall be exempt from the building thermal envelope provisions of this code:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.80.050 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "231ccc4e-171e-5929-97bd-b50f132c8141",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1031,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:8",
          "start": 866
        },
        "quote": "1. Those with a peak design rate of energy usage less than 3.4 Btu/h•ft 2 (10.7 W/m 2 ) or 1.0 watt/ft 2 (10.7 W/m 2 ) of floor area for space conditioning purposes.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.80.050 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "5f23ae7c-feb2-5da0-b1e6-16f1ea465baa",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
