          "end": 1691,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:13",
          "start": 1578
        },
        "quote": "(g) 103.1, General, is hereby deleted in its entirety and the following provisions shall be substituted therefor:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.80.050 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "8933c990-0afb-54f4-a970-5517415a3a94",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2030,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:14",
          "start": 1692
        },
        "quote": "The submittal of construction documents and plans is not required, and a separate permit shall not be issued with regard to the construction practices and techniques utilized in buildings that fall within the scope of this code. Construction or work for which a building permit is required shall be subject to the provisions of this code.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.80.050 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "4b7c62e6-af0e-574d-845a-92c3eb1e2d88",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2363,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:15",
          "start": 2031
        },
        "quote": "Exception: The code official is authorized to and may require the submittal of any necessary construction documents and other supporting data for specific projects where special or unusual conditions exist. The code official may also require that the necessary construction documents be prepared by a registered design professional.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.80.050 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "d4de9114-12d2-5cb4-8a2b-7119c46c36e9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2546,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:16",
          "start": 2364
        },
        "quote": "(h) 103.3, Examination of documents, including subsections 103.3.1, 103.3.2 and 103.3.3, is hereby deleted in its entirety and the following provisions shall be substituted therefor:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:14.80.050:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 14.80.050 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "dde7e414-5b18-5335-8ab1-54dc30e05aa0",
